!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/a-kind-of-a-namespace-type-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.1, [TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2"
  description: """
    A kind's `of` names a constructor: `kind<C>` holds the types built with `C`. `api` is a namespace type, an
    instance of `namespace` and no constructor, so no type is built with it and the kind is refused where it is
    declared. The entries holding values of `api`, such as `myapi`, are named by a reference, `ref<api>`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
